# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored - commit it so everyone
# (and CI later) gets the same pinned provider versions from `terraform init`.

# Python / Django
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
venv/
.venv/
*.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Secrets — never commit real values
*.pem
*.key
secrets.yaml
!secrets.example.yaml

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
